WEBVTT

00:36:27.204 --> 00:36:32.634
"Oh, I get it. I get how Sophia's feeling,
and she'll get there"?

00:36:32.658 --> 00:36:36.637
And the difference between
those two attitudes is profound.

00:36:36.661 --> 00:36:38.674
If you're able to feel the latter way,

00:36:38.698 --> 00:36:40.506
then you can say to your child,

00:36:40.530 --> 00:36:42.669
"You know, I understand
exactly how you feel.

00:36:42.693 --> 00:36:44.486
I get why you don't want to do that.

00:36:44.510 --> 00:36:46.645
I know it's hard.
I know you can get there.

00:36:46.669 --> 00:36:48.285
I have every faith that you can.

00:36:48.309 --> 00:36:50.705
So, we're going to work
on that little by little."

00:36:50.729 --> 00:36:55.201
CA: Is it important to know
whether your child is shy or introvert?

00:36:55.225 --> 00:36:57.721
Because it seems like those
are two different things,

00:36:57.745 --> 00:36:59.041
and that the shy child,

00:36:59.065 --> 00:37:01.244
maybe the key is just
to give them some skills